2. Objectives of the Fund  
The objectives of the Fund are to:   
i. fast-track the development of electric power projects, especially in the 
identified industrial clusters in the country;  
ii. fast-track the development of the aviation sector of the Nigerian 
economy by improving the terms of credit to Airlines;  
iii. serve as a credit enhancement instrument to improve the financial 
position of the Deposit Money Banks (DMBs); 
iv. improve power supply, generate employment, and enhance the living 
standard of the citizens through consistent power supply;  
v. provide leverage for additional private sector investments in the power 
and aviation sectors.

