3. SCOPE   
This Guidelines shall be applicable to all licensed NIFIs. The reference to NIFIs 
for the purpose of this Guidelines means:   
i. Full-fledged non-interest (Islamic) bank or full-fledged non-interest 
(Islamic) banking subsidiary of a Financial Holding Company 
(Holdco);  
ii. Full-fledged non-interest (Islamic) merchant bank   
