iv. Non-interest (Islamic) branch or window of a conventional bank;  
v. A development bank regulated by the CBN offering non-interest 
(Islamic) financial services;  
vi.  A primary mortgage bank licensed by the CBN to offer non-
interest (Islamic) financial services and  
vi. A finance company licensed by the CBN to provide non-
interest (Islamic) financial services.

